      "kind": "unresolved",
      "description": "The camera-ready paper's Eq.6 makes the previous cache an alpha fraction and the recent cache a (1-alpha) fraction, while Eq.8 states r=alpha+(1-alpha)*beta. Together with the text that retains all recent tokens and beta of previous tokens, these claims are algebraically inconsistent. Both eq6_literal and eq8_consistent treatments are exposed instead of silently choosing one interpretation.",
